This adaptation implements the full lightbox/gallery public surface through
native Foldkit Blocks, PartContext, Binding Steps and scoped browser resources.
It adapts upstream morph, geometry, motion and metadata source, with native
framework integration and deliberate API/tooling equivalents documented in
CONTRACTS.md and UPSTREAM.md. It contains no React runtime. Verification is
bounded to the concrete tests and engine receipts listed in VERIFICATION.md;
source adaptation is not a claim that every upstream test has executed.

Upstream React render/ref/prop-merging utilities are derived from Base UI,
copyright (c) 2019 Material-UI SAS, MIT licensed. The native port replaces those
React utilities with native Html builders and explicit bindings. Retained
upstream source headers and the Ramka MIT license remain applicable.
